            "review_title": "Review at The Green Box",
            "review_text": "Pippa Jones\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam71 contributions\n0\nWorthwhile visit\nSep 2026 • Friends\nThis is one of my favorite restaurants in thao dien. Amazing quality and atmosphere. The staff are very friendly and attentive. \nI come here several times a month, as a solo or group of friends. \nThe vegetarian options are very tasty and plentiful. \nThe food is high quality and displayed well within the meals. \n\nEach week there are different events on and always very fun and interesting. \nI would highly recommend a visit here. \nIt is a lovely and wholesome restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
