            "review_text": "Eoghan (Owen)\nCork, Ireland145 contributions\n0\nAmazing Food and Coffee!\nJul 2024 • Couples\nAbsolute AMAZING food and coffee here. We both had the Hallo-Me (halloumi) bowl and it was so fresh and tasty. My partner is gluten-free and they were able to accommodate this. The coffee was great too. Very chilled out atmosphere with plenty of space. Will definitely be back before we leave the city!\nWritten July 7, 2024",
